<p><sup>24</sup> <a href="#_ftnref24" name="_ftn24" title=""> </a> <a href="/medialibrary/Microsites/arrc/files/2020/ARRC-Proposed-Legislative-Solution.pdf">Proposed  Legislative Solution to Minimize Legal Uncertainty and Adverse Economic Impact  Associated with LIBOR Transition</a>, ARRC.<u> </u></p>

<p><sup>25</sup> <a href="#_ftnref25" name="_ftn25" title=""> </a> See &ldquo;Case  Study: Floating Rate Notes&rdquo; and &ldquo;Case Study: Securitizations&rdquo; in ARRC&rsquo;s <a href="/medialibrary/Microsites/arrc/files/2020/ARRC-Proposed-Legislative-Solution.pdf">proposed legislative  solution</a>.</p>

<p><sup>26</sup> <a href="#_ftnref26" name="_ftn26" title=""> </a> <a href="/medialibrary/microsites/arrc/files/2020/October-21-ARRC-Meeting-Minutes.pdf">Minutes  for the October 21, 2020 Meeting</a>, ARRC. </p>

